{"content":[{"c":["BROOK OF THE ARABAH*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Unidentifiable brook presumably draining into the Arabah (",{"href":"?bref=Amos.6.14","r":"Amos.6.14","rawR":"Amos.6.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Amos.6.14","value":"Amos.6.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Am 6:14"},"). The Arabah is part of the desert rift extending from the Sea of Galilee to East Africa. A wadi (streambed) named Arabah is south of the Salt (Dead) Sea, but in the Bible, Arabah (“desert” or “wilderness”) designates portions of the Jordan Valley (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.4.48-49","r":"Deut.4.48-49","rawR":"Deut.4.48-49","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.4.48-49","value":"Deut.4.48-49"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 4:48-49"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.8.14","r":"Josh.8.14","rawR":"Josh.8.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.8.14","value":"Josh.8.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 8:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.25.4","r":"2Kgs.25.4","rawR":"2Kgs.25.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.25.4","value":"2Kgs.25.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 25:4"},") as well as the Salt Sea (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.3.17","r":"Deut.3.17","rawR":"Deut.3.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.3.17","value":"Deut.3.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 3:17"},"). In the Wadi Arabah several springs and occasionally rain-fed streams drain into the Salt Sea."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Arabah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Arabah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Arabah_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Arabah"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BrookoftheArabah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Am 6:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Amos.6.14","rawQueryValue":"Amos.6.14","sourceRefExact":"Amos.6.14"},{"anchorText":"Dt 4:48-49","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.4.48-49","rawQueryValue":"Deut.4.48-49","sourceRefExact":"Deut.4.48-49"},{"anchorText":"Jos 8:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.8.14","rawQueryValue":"Josh.8.14","sourceRefExact":"Josh.8.14"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 25:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.25.4","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.25.4","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.25.4"},{"anchorText":"Dt 3:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.3.17","rawQueryValue":"Deut.3.17","sourceRefExact":"Deut.3.17"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8cf36c2b99495809fb86152859379951085fbae211ba665b51b0d97d5f7dde9a","sourceItemName":"BrookoftheArabah","sourceItemOrder":423,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BrookoftheArabah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Brook of the Arabah*","title":"Brook of the Arabah*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}